{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2022-01-13 10:02:00', 'title': "EPAM NAMED '2022 BEST PLACES TO WORK'", 'text': 'NEWTOWN, PA., JAN. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BUILT IN TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. (NYSE: EPAM), A LEADING DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION SERVICES AND PRODUCT ENGINEERING COMPANY, WAS HONORED IN ITS 2022 BEST PLACES TO WORK AWARDS FOR THE LARGE COMPANY CATEGORY IN NEW YORK CITY AND SAN FRANCISCO.'}